{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e1d3d6006945d2800982","chatId":"12b2350079e347df96fa3c02c7c500fd","sessionId":null,"userId":56947,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":746,"promptTokens":1539,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:35"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01406362456384003,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1d3d6006945d2800981","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367955790,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e1d3d6006945d2800981","chatId":"12b2350079e347df96fa3c02c7c500fd","sessionId":null,"userId":56947,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n鸿杰去银行帮朋友办事，朋友在外地，他找到工作人员要来了办事需要填写的表单，看到了签名那栏，愣住了，因为显示要本人签字。\n他很耿直的问工作人员：“我朋友在外地，我可以代签吗？”\n工作人员说：“这里有监控，是没法别人代签的，出去找本人签。”\n他很着急的说：“我朋友真的回不来，行个方便吧。”\n工作人员还是那句话：“这里有监控，别人没法代签，出去找本人签。”\n\n[问题]\n当工作人员说这句话时，他真正想说的是什么？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 工作人员在暗示鸿杰可以走出银行后帮朋友代签。\nB. 工作人员是再次确认了规定，即银行内不允许他人代签。\nC. 工作人员是在建议鸿杰去找合适的签字工具。\nD. 工作人员是在硬性要求鸿杰必须找他的朋友来银行签字。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01406362456384003,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1d3d6006945d2800982","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367955787,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"a97f3b92ad8e44028dfd39800277efa2"}